            // We need the factory address embedded in the runtime code.

            // Let's build it step by step in assembly

            // Step 1: Write the creation code to memory
            // Creation code: 0x600b600c6000396000f3 (COPY runtime to mem, RETURN)
            // But we need the right offsets.

            // Let me calculate:
            // Creation code length: 12 bytes (PUSH1 offset, PUSH1 size, PUSH1 0x00, CODECOPY, PUSH1 0x00, RETURN)
