            // Where XX = runtime size, and 0x0c = creation code length (where runtime starts)

            // Actually, the standard ERC1967 proxy creation code is:
            // 67363d3d373d3d3d363d73 <20-byte-addr> 5af43d82803e903d91602b57fd5bf3

            // That's the ERC-1167 minimal proxy pattern adapted for ERC1967.
